From 27422044111fdc208e6f03f52fbcb466cdd3c575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:09:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 343/371] family server: a Black Pearl fort no longer closes
 the game when it reaches the client

Since 0426 the Black Pearl barricade forts really reach the clients near them. The AI sends every fort with
AvatarTypes.AnyAvatar (DistributedBattleAvatarAI's default; DistributedFortAI never changes it), and the client's
DistributedBattleAvatar.setAvatarType looks the height up in EnemyGlobals: AnyAvatar has no stats, getHeight is
None, and max(10.0, None) raised a TypeError that closed the game 4 s after a fresh Black Pearl instance was made
(boats' BPFORT6, two identical tracebacks).

DistributedFort now has its own setAvatarType that keeps the type only. The fort already sets its own battle
tube (50 x 100) in announceGenerate; its height stays the battle avatar's default 5.0. Client only; the AI is
unchanged. Offline sim with the real client DistributedFort class and the type the AI sends (boats'
sim_fortavtype.py): HEAD FAIL with the same TypeError, patched PASS (no exception, type kept, height 5.0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pirates/world/DistributedFort.py | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pirates/world/DistributedFort.py b/pirates/world/DistributedFort.py
index c10cdb4..64c13f0 100644
--- a/pirates/world/DistributedFort.py
+++ b/pirates/world/DistributedFort.py
@@ -56,6 +56,12 @@ class DistributedFort(DistributedBattleAvatar.DistributedBattleAvatar):
         if self.islandRequest:
             self.cr.relatedObjectMgr.abortRequest(self.islandRequest)
 
+    def setAvatarType(self, avatarType):
+        # a fort is sent with AvatarTypes.AnyAvatar, which has no enemy stats (getHeight is None), and the battle
+        # avatar's max(10.0, None) closed the game for everyone near the Black Pearl once the forts reached the
+        # client (0426; boats' BPFORT6). Keep the type only: announceGenerate sets the fort's own 50 x 100 battle tube.
+        self.avatarType = avatarType
+
     def setIslandId(self, islandId):
         self.islandId = islandId
 
